body.en:
A **statistical hypothesis** is a claim about:
1. the **value of a parameter** (mean, variance, proportion…);
2. the **equality of parameters** of two distributions;
3. the **shape of a distribution**.

Cases 1 and 2: **parametric**. Case 3: **non-parametric**.
